    note: "UNITY SPACE, ship-root frame. Where `CamChanger` PARKS the camera rig on CHANGE VIEW (X / C) — a PARKING SPACE, NOT AN ARM. The rig does not stay here: the same GameObject carries a live SmoothTransformConstraint that flies it to `cam target 3rdPerson`, and a DelayedReparent that cuts it loose from the ship 0.25 s in. Read `camera.thirdPersonChase` for where the camera actually goes. DEV-128 read this as the whole third-person camera and DEV-150 corrected it; DEV-156 ported it.",
